WEBVTT

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:10.380
The flames of war rage on,

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:16.950
as hearts become seduced by the crimson sphere.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:25.230
The God of Fate beckons,

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:39.010
as every dream becomes stained with blood.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.050
Chapter Seven

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.050
Kagura

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:25.700
Hey, be careful, will you?

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:27.830
It's not my fault, you know.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:34.710
We will now head...

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:38.960
to a village situated in Suruga, called Kagura.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:39.880
Kagura?

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:41.300
Yes.

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:46.100
There's a place there that's guarded by one of our members, Tonba.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:49.140
The guy who drew the painting in Sakafune.

00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:51.310
This will be my first time meeting him though.

00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:53.940
You believe Kuromitsu to be concealed there?

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:55.730
Yes.

00:01:55.730 --> 00:02:02.030
Twenty years ago, she withdrew there to escape the unrelenting skirmishing.

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:11.040
Kuon, have you...

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:17.380
Have you ever met Kuromitsu?

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:22.930
No, I'm not interested in her.

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:27.140
I've heard that she's worshiped in Kagura.

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:30.310
They took her there in order to imprison her,

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:34.900
but the villagers now say that they protect her voluntarily.

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.110
Have you actually met her?

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.440
That means only Saniwa has?

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:43.200
I suppose so.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:47.240
This is the first time we've been told her whereabouts.

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:01.670
What's wrong?

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:05.510
What kind of woman was she?

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:07.510
Kuromitsu...

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:11.970
You should know that yourself, should you not?

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:14.060
I do not.

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:19.400
I know nothing about her.

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:21.610
My intuition tells me that.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:27.450
What you currently know about Lady Kuromitsu is all you need to know.

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:32.450
She longs to see you.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.960
You also wish to seek her out.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:38.290
Are further reasons necessary?

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:15.290
From this point onwards, we shall walk.

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:18.290
I will guide us.

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:23.920
Is Kuromitsu really in these mountains, Saniwa?

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.840
We require her to be concealed from the enemy.

00:04:27.670 --> 00:04:30.430
Kagura is perfect for that purpose.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:34.310
For it is a village where the residents live in isolation.

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:36.940
So that's how it is.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:39.190
Do you know something, Karuta?

00:04:39.190 --> 00:04:42.230
You've heard of "Moles," haven't you?

00:04:42.230 --> 00:04:47.690
Due to the effects of the Great Disaster, people created underground villages to live in.

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:50.280
Kagura is one of those.

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:51.050
Was I mistaken?

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:20.080
They're here!

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:21.290
It's Kuromitsu!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:48.610
What troubles you?

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:57.370
It matters not.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:14.340
Hey!

00:07:29.940 --> 00:07:32.320
This is... Kagura?

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.400
It is.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.490
Everyone is waiting inside.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:53.380
Wait.

00:07:59.050 --> 00:07:59.890
What?

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:01.100
What's wrong, Kuro?

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:02.970
Do you sense something?

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:05.850
An ominous presence.

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:09.190
What should we do?

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:13.780
Let us enter.

00:08:57.360 --> 00:09:00.490
It sure is... quiet.

00:09:00.490 --> 00:09:02.620
No one's coming to greet us.

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:05.490
Saniwa...

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:28.930
What happened here?

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:32.270
Lady Kuromitsu...

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:49.580
How?

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:52.170
What has transpired here?!

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:54.040
Hey, I found a survivor.

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:06.100
Tonba!

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:18.230
Tonba, what has befallen this place?!

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:21.990
What ails you?!

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:23.320
Tonba!

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:39.050
What... is this?

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:42.720
Ivy?

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:46.720
Ivy and human blood?

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.890
Could they have been...

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:14.910
The Red Army committed this.

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:17.500
Saniwa, you know something?

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:22.880
I have heard tales of fiends that are able to use forest ivy to murder people.

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:27.840
It is likely that Lady Kuromitsu has been captured by them.

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:32.270
Are there no other survivors?

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:33.970
Let us separate and search.

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:36.640
Tonba, remain here.

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:06.920
What's wrong?

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:11.600
You're exhausted?

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:13.810
Pathetic.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.430
I am not.

00:12:18.310 --> 00:12:19.650
Don't overexert yourself.

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:21.940
Take this.

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:31.200
The blood of a human. You can tell by the smell, right?

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:36.540
Your body is not made of steel.

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:39.120
You must take care of it.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:45.460
Looks like this place has been completely destroyed.

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:49.880
Though, I don't know if the enemy is still here.

00:12:49.880 --> 00:12:51.720
Be on your guard.

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:27.170
Kumaso...

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:29.800
Even you, who was so brave...

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:33.720
Were you two close?

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:37.310
He had great skill with a bow.

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:41.230
It was as if his arrows had the ability to trail their prey...

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:49.440
Nagi's hands could find the source of a person's illness and cure it without harming them.

00:13:51.320 --> 00:13:53.200
Everyone here had special abilities like that?

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:57.370
They are mutations resulting from the Great Disaster.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:02.870
As a form of compensation, each of us gained abilities that surpassed the normal capabilities of humans.

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:05.130
"Us...?"

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:10.340
This is my homeland.

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:25.540
What shall we do, Kuromitsu?

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:27.540
We will arrive shortly at Kagura.

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:29.130
It's a trap.

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:31.750
Enemies wait to ambush us there.

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:33.510
In that case, where should we go?

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:36.760
They will find us eventually.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:39.050
I am here as well.

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:42.100
Everything will be fine as long as the two of us are together.

00:15:55.530 --> 00:15:56.600
They're here!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:57.700
It's Kuromitsu!

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:28.100
Kuromitsu...

00:16:28.730 --> 00:16:30.020
Has it ended?

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:34.530
Yes. However, I still feel nervous.

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:36.570
Was I mistaken?

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:38.610
My body is heavy.

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:42.030
It feels as though my blood is starting to coagulate.

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:50.460
Fret not. Soon, everything will return to the way it was.

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:51.750
Is that so?

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:54.420
You are not complete.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:59.130
The healing abilities of your body are unable to keep pace with you.

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:00.180
My body...

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:02.680
Yes.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:05.680
That is why there is nothing to fret about.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.390
Endure a little longer.

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:34.590
Who is this Kuromitsu?

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:36.500
What could she be?!

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:47.970
What is the meaning of this?!

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:51.190
What have you witnessed?!

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:53.900
What on Earth have you witnessed?!

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:23.470
What is happening here?

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:35.690
Flash

00:18:45.110 --> 00:18:47.120
What happened?

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:49.080
What about Saniwa and Rai?

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:50.240
They should be up ahead.

00:18:58.210 --> 00:18:59.210
Saniwa!

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:07.390
Let's get outta here!

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:38.750
I see you managed to escape with your lives.

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:42.630
Your tenacity alone is praiseworthy.

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:45.760
What a wretched brat.

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:49.720
If no one tells him where he's going,

00:19:49.720 --> 00:19:57.390
he'll be unable to tell if he's gone to Heaven or Hell.

00:19:57.390 --> 00:19:59.480
The Red Army...

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:01.320
So you are responsible for this!

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:28.170
Next Chapter

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:28.170
The
Screeching
Ivy
